      "author": "Antonio G. Di Benedetto",
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-01T20:02:31.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/05/Screenshot_20260531_212701.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,9.3778095086996,100,81.244380982601",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/941215/windows-laptops-nvidia-rtx-spark-apple-m1-arm-price-ram",
