      "id": "bbc-2026-06-01-missing-girl-15-may-be-with-wanted-man-say-police",
      "title": "Missing girl, 15, may be with wanted man, say police",
      "summary": "Teenager is thought to be with a man wanted for recall to prison by West Mercia Police.",
      "body": "West Mercia PoliceChanelle, 15, was reported missing on ThursdayPolice believe a 15-year-old girl, reported missing on Thursday, may be with a wanted man.The West Mercia force believes the girl, named only as Chanelle, could be in the Bridgnorth or Oswestry areas of Shropshire, elsewhere in the county, or have travelled into Wales.Officers issued a picture of Kyle Braine, 24, who is currently wanted for recall to prison.The force originally appealed for information about his whereabouts on 21 May, when it said he had links to Baschurch, Shrewsbury, Telford and Birmingham.Chanelle was last seen wearing black leggings and a black Airmax puffer coat.Anyone who has seen either of them is asked to call 999 immediately. West Mercia Police added that any other information about their whereabouts could be shared by calling 101.",
