      "body": "Ask HN: Who wants to be hired? (June 2026)115 points by whoishiring 15 hours ago  | hide | past | favorite | 314 commentsShare your information if you are looking for work. Please use this format:  Location:\nPlease only post if you are personally looking for work. Agencies, recruiters, job boards,\nand so on, are off topic here.Readers: please only email these addresses to discuss work opportunities.Searchers: try https://nthesis.ai/public/hn-wants-to-be-hired, https://www.wantstobehired.com. help\nIT Operations & Endpoint Management | macOS, Kandji, Identity, SaaS Administration | 7+ Years | Chicago / RemoteLocation: Chicago, IL, USARemote: YesWilling to relocate: Only for great opportunityTechnologies:\nmacOS administration, Kandji, Apple Business Manager, Microsoft Intune, Entra ID (Azure AD), Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, SSO/SAML/SCIM, ServiceNow, IT Asset Management, Windows administration, Linux, SaaS administration, technical documentation, knowledge management, AI workflow automation.Background:\nIT Operations and Endpoint Management professional with 7+ years of experience supporting Apple-first and mixed-platform environments. My expertise includes macOS administration, endpoint management, identity and access management, SaaS operations, and IT asset management. I've built and improved onboarding workflows, device management programs, documentation systems, and support processes at both large enterprises and high-growth technology companies.Résumé/CV: https://www.linkedin.com/in/corbett-baratta-323907b3/Email: cjbaratta@outlook.com\nLocation: SloveniaRemote: YesWilling to relocate: NoTechnologies: rust, c#, GCP, AWS, solidjs, ffmpeg, videoRésumé/CV: please contactEmail: hellohn@smmx.devPast year - launched multi platform walkie-talkie like system, rust backend + shared lib, native clients for ios/android, slintui for desktop - https://ioxsoft.net/ioxcom - now working on bonding solution to send video/data stream over multiple paths\nOt