      "author": "Antonio G. Di Benedetto",
      "publishedAt": "2026-05-31T15:00:00.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/05/268564_Asus_ROG_Strix_Scar_18_ELMB_2026_handson_prepro_ADiBenedetto_ADiBenedetto_0007.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,10.732984293194,100,78.534031413613",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/940221/asus-rog-strix-scar-18-elmb-gaming-laptop-motion-blur-handson-impressions",
      "readTimeMinutes": 8,
