      "id": "bbc-2026-05-31-watch-key-moments-from-nicola-sturgeon-s-interview-with-laur",
      "title": "Watch: Key moments from Nicola Sturgeon's interview with Laura Kuenssberg",
      "summary": "Former First Minister of Scotland Nicola Sturgeon speaks to the BBC in her first interview since her estranged husband Peter Murrell pled guilty to embezzling £400,000 from the SNP",
      "body": "Former First Minister of Scotland Nicola Sturgeon has spoken to the BBC in her first interview since her estranged husband Peter Murrell pled guilty to embezzling £400,000 from the SNP.Speaking to Laura Kuenssberg, Sturgeon said: \"I am not responsible for the crimes that my former husband committed and I'm not going to apologise for somebody else's crimes\".She felt she was \"serving a sentence for a crime I did not commit\". On Monday, Murrell, the SNP's former chief executive, admitted using party funds to purchase items including luxury goods, jewellery, cosmetics, two cars and a motorhome. Sturgeon has consistently denied any knowledge of Murrell's crimes. You can read more on this story from the BBC's Laura Kuenssberg hereAnd watch the full interview on iPlayer",
